 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Verbs that break",
   "texto": [
    "Many German verbs carry a particle that **se separa** to the conjugate and **al final** goes from the phrase.",
    "**aufstehen** (get up): **Ich stehe früh auf** (get up early).",
    "**anfangen** (start): **Ich fange um neun Uhr an** (start at nine).",
    "**fernsehen** (see TV): **Ich sehe fern** (see TV).",
    "In the dictionary you will find them together; in the phrase, separate."
   ]
  },
