  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "The verb is still second.",
   "texto": [
    "If the phrase starts with a word of time, the subject goes behind the verb: **Dann gehe ich zur Arbeit** (then I go to work), **Abends esse ich** (at night dinner).",
    "The parts of the day: **morgens** (morning), **mittags** (noon), **abends** (evening), **nachts** (night).",
    "**Jeden Tag** = every day. **Früh** = early. **Spät** = late."
